<p><a href="https://blog.jim-nielsen.com/2026/tribute-to-om/">Jim Nielsen</a>:</p>

<blockquote>
  <p>One day on Twitter I got a DM from someone with the handle @om.</p>

<p>“I don’t know who this is,” I thought, “but damn that is a great
