<p>Om seemingly read <em>everything</em>.</p>

<p><a href="https://spyglass.org/om/">MG Siegler</a>:</p>

<blockquote>
  <blockquote>
  <p>Looking at my emails and social media <a href="https://x.com/search?q=from%3A%40mgsiegler%20%40om&amp;src=typed_query&amp;ref=spyglass.org">messages</a>
from back then is just a treasure trove. Om was always quick with
a compliment about something I had written but also with a
criticism at times. He clearly just read endlessly and couldn’t
